<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) Apical Constriction Wedge-Cell Tapering & Somitecoel Lumen Equilibrium Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that apical actomyosin constriction (gamma_ap > gamma_bas > 0) enforces wedge-cell tapering (L_ap < L_bas) and stabilizes a finite central somitecoel lumen | Variables: R_in: inner somitecoel lumen radius (um); R_out: outer somite rosette radius (um); N: number of radial wedge cells; gamma_ap: apical actomyosin tension; gamma_bas: basal ECM-engaged tension; gamma_lat: lateral N-cadherin tension" ;
    dct:source "Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Figs. 1-3; Adhyapok et al. (2021) Dev. Cell 56:1312-1324 Figs. 2-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L200-L379>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L24-L60> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def wedge_arc_length (theta_scaled R : Int) : Int :=
  theta_scaled * R
def rosette_lumen_numerator (N_lat two_pi_gamma_ap : Int) : Int :=
  N_lat - two_pi_gamma_ap
def rosette_basal_denominator (N_lat two_pi_gamma_bas : Int) : Int :=
  N_lat + two_pi_gamma_bas
theorem yamanaka_adhyapok_wedge_rosette_tapering
    (theta_scaled R_in R_out N_lat two_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_gamma_bas : Int)
    (h_theta : 0 < theta_scaled)
    (h_rad : R_in < R_out)
    (h_bas : 0 < two_pi_gamma_bas)
    (h_ap : two_pi_gamma_bas < two_pi_gamma_ap) :
    wedge_arc_length theta_scaled R_in < wedge_arc_length theta_scaled R_out ∧
    rosette_lumen_numerator N_lat two_pi_gamma_ap <
      rosette_basal_denominator N_lat two_pi_gamma_bas"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "R_in^* / R_out^* = L_ap^* / L_bas^* = (N * gamma_lat - 2 * pi * gamma_ap) / (N * gamma_lat + 2 * pi * gamma_bas) < 1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.wedge_arc_length" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.yamanaka_adhyapok_wedge_rosette_tapering" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Adhyapok et al. (2021) EphA4/ephrinB2 Inter-Somite Cleft Boundary Sorting Energy Barrier Law" ;
    dct:description "Establishes that heterotypic EphA4/ephrinB2 repulsion (2*gamma_het > gamma_ant + gamma_post) creates a positive energy barrier that drives physical somite cleft separation | Variables: L_cleft: inter-somitic boundary contact length (um); gamma_het: heterotypic EphA4-ephrinB2 interfacial tension; gamma_ant, gamma_post: homotypic intra-somite cell-cell tensions" ;
    dct:source "Adhyapok et al. (2021) Dev. Cell 56:1312-1324 Figs. 1-3; Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Fig. 2" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L722-L748>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L62-L90> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def eph_cleft_sorting_energy (L_cleft gamma_het gamma_ant gamma_post : Int) : Int :=
  L_cleft * (2 * gamma_het - (gamma_ant + gamma_post))
theorem adhyapok_2021_eph_ephrin_cleft_sorting_barrier
    (L_cleft gamma_het gamma_het_kd gamma_ant gamma_post : Int)
    (h_len : 0 < L_cleft)
    (h_rep : gamma_ant + gamma_post < 2 * gamma_het)
    (h_kd : 2 * gamma_het_kd = gamma_ant + gamma_post) :
    0 < eph_cleft_sorting_energy L_cleft gamma_het gamma_ant gamma_post ∧
    eph_cleft_sorting_energy L_cleft gamma_het_kd gamma_ant gamma_post = 0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Delta_E_cleft = L_cleft * (2 * gamma_het - (gamma_ant + gamma_post)) > 0  when 2 * gamma_het > gamma_ant + gamma_post" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.eph_cleft_sorting_energy" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.adhyapok_2021_eph_ephrin_cleft_sorting_barrier" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023) & Miao et al. (2023) Y-27632 ROCK Inhibition & Minus-Matrigel Curvature Collapse Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that ROCK inhibition (Y-27632) or absence of Matrigel ECM abolishes the apico-basal tension differential and dilates the somitecoel lumen relative to wild-type MET rosettes | Variables: gamma_ap_wt: wild-type apical actomyosin tension under RhoA/ROCK activation; gamma_bas: basal ECM tension; N_lat: lateral N-cadherin adhesion term N*gamma_lat" ;
    dct:source "Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Fig. 3; Miao et al. (2023) Nature 614:500-508 Fig. 4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L381-L413,L750-L822>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L92-L119> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def apico_basal_tension_diff (gamma_ap gamma_bas : Int) : Int :=
  gamma_ap - gamma_bas
theorem yamanaka_2023_rock_inhibition_curvature_collapse
    (N_lat gamma_ap_wt gamma_bas : Int)
    (h_wt : gamma_bas < gamma_ap_wt) :
    apico_basal_tension_diff gamma_bas gamma_bas = 0 ∧
    0 < apico_basal_tension_diff gamma_ap_wt gamma_bas ∧
    rosette_lumen_numerator N_lat gamma_ap_wt <
      rosette_lumen_numerator N_lat gamma_bas"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "gamma_ap = gamma_bas  =>  Delta_gamma_{ap-bas} = gamma_ap - gamma_bas = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.apico_basal_tension_diff" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.yamanaka_2023_rock_inhibition_curvature_collapse" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023) 3D Polyhedral Shell Somitecoel Lumen Pressurization Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that lumen pressure strictly dilates the 3D somitecoel equilibrium and that the closed-shell condition is the two-surface Laplace bound P < 2 (gamma_ap + gamma_bas) / R_in; the discrete 2 N_3D-DOF polyhedral relaxation reproduces the closed form to < 1e-3 | Variables: Lambda = gamma_lat * (total angular lateral edge length) / 2 for the N_3D-cell spherical Voronoi shell; gamma_ap, gamma_bas: apical and basal face tensions; P: somitecoel lumen pressure (gamma_lat / um); R_in: lumen radius" ;
    dct:source "Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Figs. 2-3 (somitecoel lumen); Gomez-Galvez et al. (2018) Nat Commun 9:2960 (polyhedral/scutoid shell geometry)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L415-L714>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L122-L163> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def shell_lumen_numerator (Lam four_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_P_Rin : Int) : Int :=
  Lam - four_pi_gamma_ap + two_pi_P_Rin
def shell_basal_denominator (Lam four_pi_gamma_bas : Int) : Int :=
  Lam + four_pi_gamma_bas
theorem yamanaka_2023_shell_lumen_pressurization
    (Lam four_pi_gamma_ap four_pi_gamma_bas two_pi_P_Rin : Int)
    (h_P : 0 < two_pi_P_Rin)
    (h_bas : 0 < four_pi_gamma_bas)
    (h_ap : 0 < four_pi_gamma_ap) :
    shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap 0 <
      shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_P_Rin ∧
    (shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_P_Rin <
        shell_basal_denominator Lam four_pi_gamma_bas ↔
      two_pi_P_Rin < four_pi_gamma_ap + four_pi_gamma_bas) ∧
    shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap 0 <
      shell_basal_denominator Lam four_pi_gamma_bas"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "rho_3D = R_in / R_out = (Lambda - 4 pi gamma_ap + 2 pi P R_in) / (Lambda + 4 pi gamma_bas);  rho_3D < 1 iff 2 pi P R_in < 4 pi (gamma_ap + gamma_bas)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.shell_lumen_numerator" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.yamanaka_2023_shell_lumen_pressurization" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) / Cooke & Zeeman (1976) HES7 Clock-Wavefront Arrest & Tension Maturation Gradient Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves the clock-and-wavefront segment-length law S = v T and the anterior-to-posterior MET maturation gradient that the live HES7 -> MESP2/RIPPLY2 -> tension coupling feeds into the vertex rosette solver | Variables: v: determination wavefront speed (um/h); T: HES7 clock period (h); t_arrest: wavefront passage time of a cell; k: linearised RhoA/ROCK (or EphA4/ephrinB2) tension ramp slope; gamma_base: pre-MET baseline tension" ;
    dct:source "Lewis (2003) Curr Biol 13:1398-1408; Cooke & Zeeman (1976) J Theor Biol 58:455-476; Diaz-Cuadros et al. (2020) Nature 580:113-118; Matsuda et al. (2020) Nature 580:124-129; Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Fig. 4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L824-L1121>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L165-L212> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def segment_length (v T : Int) : Int :=
  v * T
def cell_age (t t_arrest : Int) : Int :=
  t - t_arrest
def tension_ramp (gamma_base k age : Int) : Int :=
  gamma_base + k * age
theorem hes7_wavefront_arrest_tension_gradient
    (v T_short T_long t t_ant t_post gamma_base k : Int)
    (h_v : 0 < v)
    (h_T : T_short < T_long)
    (h_order : t_ant < t_post)
    (h_t : t_post ≤ t)
    (h_k : 0 < k) :
    segment_length v T_short < segment_length v T_long ∧
    (0 ≤ cell_age t t_post ∧ cell_age t t_post < cell_age t t_ant) ∧
    tension_ramp gamma_base k (cell_age t t_post) <
      tension_ramp gamma_base k (cell_age t t_ant)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "S = v * T_HES7 ;  gamma(t) = gamma_base + k * (t - t_arrest) ;  t_ant < t_post <= t  =>  gamma_ant(t) > gamma_post(t)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.segment_length" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.hes7_wavefront_arrest_tension_gradient" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) Apical Constriction Wedge-Cell Tapering & Somitecoel Lumen Equilibrium Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that apical actomyosin constriction (gamma_ap > gamma_bas > 0) enforces wedge-cell tapering (L_ap < L_bas) and stabilizes a finite central somitecoel lumen | Variables: R_in: inner somitecoel lumen radius (um); R_out: outer somite rosette radius (um); N: number of radial wedge cells; gamma_ap: apical actomyosin tension; gamma_bas: basal ECM-engaged tension; gamma_lat: lateral N-cadherin tension" ;
    dct:source "Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Figs. 1-3; Adhyapok et al. (2021) Dev. Cell 56:1312-1324 Figs. 2-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L200-L379>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L24-L60> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def wedge_arc_length (theta_scaled R : Int) : Int :=
  theta_scaled * R
def rosette_lumen_numerator (N_lat two_pi_gamma_ap : Int) : Int :=
  N_lat - two_pi_gamma_ap
def rosette_basal_denominator (N_lat two_pi_gamma_bas : Int) : Int :=
  N_lat + two_pi_gamma_bas
theorem yamanaka_adhyapok_wedge_rosette_tapering
    (theta_scaled R_in R_out N_lat two_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_gamma_bas : Int)
    (h_theta : 0 < theta_scaled)
    (h_rad : R_in < R_out)
    (h_bas : 0 < two_pi_gamma_bas)
    (h_ap : two_pi_gamma_bas < two_pi_gamma_ap) :
    wedge_arc_length theta_scaled R_in < wedge_arc_length theta_scaled R_out ∧
    rosette_lumen_numerator N_lat two_pi_gamma_ap <
      rosette_basal_denominator N_lat two_pi_gamma_bas"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "R_in^* / R_out^* = L_ap^* / L_bas^* = (N * gamma_lat - 2 * pi * gamma_ap) / (N * gamma_lat + 2 * pi * gamma_bas) < 1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.wedge_arc_length" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.yamanaka_adhyapok_wedge_rosette_tapering" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Adhyapok et al. (2021) EphA4/ephrinB2 Inter-Somite Cleft Boundary Sorting Energy Barrier Law" ;
    dct:description "Establishes that heterotypic EphA4/ephrinB2 repulsion (2*gamma_het > gamma_ant + gamma_post) creates a positive energy barrier that drives physical somite cleft separation | Variables: L_cleft: inter-somitic boundary contact length (um); gamma_het: heterotypic EphA4-ephrinB2 interfacial tension; gamma_ant, gamma_post: homotypic intra-somite cell-cell tensions" ;
    dct:source "Adhyapok et al. (2021) Dev. Cell 56:1312-1324 Figs. 1-3; Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Fig. 2" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L722-L748>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L62-L90> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def eph_cleft_sorting_energy (L_cleft gamma_het gamma_ant gamma_post : Int) : Int :=
  L_cleft * (2 * gamma_het - (gamma_ant + gamma_post))
theorem adhyapok_2021_eph_ephrin_cleft_sorting_barrier
    (L_cleft gamma_het gamma_het_kd gamma_ant gamma_post : Int)
    (h_len : 0 < L_cleft)
    (h_rep : gamma_ant + gamma_post < 2 * gamma_het)
    (h_kd : 2 * gamma_het_kd = gamma_ant + gamma_post) :
    0 < eph_cleft_sorting_energy L_cleft gamma_het gamma_ant gamma_post ∧
    eph_cleft_sorting_energy L_cleft gamma_het_kd gamma_ant gamma_post = 0"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Delta_E_cleft = L_cleft * (2 * gamma_het - (gamma_ant + gamma_post)) > 0  when 2 * gamma_het > gamma_ant + gamma_post" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.eph_cleft_sorting_energy" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.adhyapok_2021_eph_ephrin_cleft_sorting_barrier" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023) & Miao et al. (2023) Y-27632 ROCK Inhibition & Minus-Matrigel Curvature Collapse Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that ROCK inhibition (Y-27632) or absence of Matrigel ECM abolishes the apico-basal tension differential and dilates the somitecoel lumen relative to wild-type MET rosettes | Variables: gamma_ap_wt: wild-type apical actomyosin tension under RhoA/ROCK activation; gamma_bas: basal ECM tension; N_lat: lateral N-cadherin adhesion term N*gamma_lat" ;
    dct:source "Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Fig. 3; Miao et al. (2023) Nature 614:500-508 Fig. 4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L381-L413,L750-L822>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L92-L119> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def apico_basal_tension_diff (gamma_ap gamma_bas : Int) : Int :=
  gamma_ap - gamma_bas
theorem yamanaka_2023_rock_inhibition_curvature_collapse
    (N_lat gamma_ap_wt gamma_bas : Int)
    (h_wt : gamma_bas < gamma_ap_wt) :
    apico_basal_tension_diff gamma_bas gamma_bas = 0 ∧
    0 < apico_basal_tension_diff gamma_ap_wt gamma_bas ∧
    rosette_lumen_numerator N_lat gamma_ap_wt <
      rosette_lumen_numerator N_lat gamma_bas"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "gamma_ap = gamma_bas  =>  Delta_gamma_{ap-bas} = gamma_ap - gamma_bas = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.apico_basal_tension_diff" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.yamanaka_2023_rock_inhibition_curvature_collapse" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023) 3D Polyhedral Shell Somitecoel Lumen Pressurization Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that lumen pressure strictly dilates the 3D somitecoel equilibrium and that the closed-shell condition is the two-surface Laplace bound P < 2 (gamma_ap + gamma_bas) / R_in; the discrete 2 N_3D-DOF polyhedral relaxation reproduces the closed form to < 1e-3 | Variables: Lambda = gamma_lat * (total angular lateral edge length) / 2 for the N_3D-cell spherical Voronoi shell; gamma_ap, gamma_bas: apical and basal face tensions; P: somitecoel lumen pressure (gamma_lat / um); R_in: lumen radius" ;
    dct:source "Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Figs. 2-3 (somitecoel lumen); Gomez-Galvez et al. (2018) Nat Commun 9:2960 (polyhedral/scutoid shell geometry)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L415-L714>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L122-L163> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def shell_lumen_numerator (Lam four_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_P_Rin : Int) : Int :=
  Lam - four_pi_gamma_ap + two_pi_P_Rin
def shell_basal_denominator (Lam four_pi_gamma_bas : Int) : Int :=
  Lam + four_pi_gamma_bas
theorem yamanaka_2023_shell_lumen_pressurization
    (Lam four_pi_gamma_ap four_pi_gamma_bas two_pi_P_Rin : Int)
    (h_P : 0 < two_pi_P_Rin)
    (h_bas : 0 < four_pi_gamma_bas)
    (h_ap : 0 < four_pi_gamma_ap) :
    shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap 0 <
      shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_P_Rin ∧
    (shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap two_pi_P_Rin <
        shell_basal_denominator Lam four_pi_gamma_bas ↔
      two_pi_P_Rin < four_pi_gamma_ap + four_pi_gamma_bas) ∧
    shell_lumen_numerator Lam four_pi_gamma_ap 0 <
      shell_basal_denominator Lam four_pi_gamma_bas"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "rho_3D = R_in / R_out = (Lambda - 4 pi gamma_ap + 2 pi P R_in) / (Lambda + 4 pi gamma_bas);  rho_3D < 1 iff 2 pi P R_in < 4 pi (gamma_ap + gamma_bas)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.shell_lumen_numerator" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.yamanaka_2023_shell_lumen_pressurization" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) / Cooke & Zeeman (1976) HES7 Clock-Wavefront Arrest & Tension Maturation Gradient Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves the clock-and-wavefront segment-length law S = v T and the anterior-to-posterior MET maturation gradient that the live HES7 -> MESP2/RIPPLY2 -> tension coupling feeds into the vertex rosette solver | Variables: v: determination wavefront speed (um/h); T: HES7 clock period (h); t_arrest: wavefront passage time of a cell; k: linearised RhoA/ROCK (or EphA4/ephrinB2) tension ramp slope; gamma_base: pre-MET baseline tension" ;
    dct:source "Lewis (2003) Curr Biol 13:1398-1408; Cooke & Zeeman (1976) J Theor Biol 58:455-476; Diaz-Cuadros et al. (2020) Nature 580:113-118; Matsuda et al. (2020) Nature 580:124-129; Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 Fig. 4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py#L824-L1121>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_029_somitoid_chirality_buckling.lean#L165-L212> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def segment_length (v T : Int) : Int :=
  v * T
def cell_age (t t_arrest : Int) : Int :=
  t - t_arrest
def tension_ramp (gamma_base k age : Int) : Int :=
  gamma_base + k * age
theorem hes7_wavefront_arrest_tension_gradient
    (v T_short T_long t t_ant t_post gamma_base k : Int)
    (h_v : 0 < v)
    (h_T : T_short < T_long)
    (h_order : t_ant < t_post)
    (h_t : t_post ≤ t)
    (h_k : 0 < k) :
    segment_length v T_short < segment_length v T_long ∧
    (0 ≤ cell_age t t_post ∧ cell_age t t_post < cell_age t t_ant) ∧
    tension_ramp gamma_base k (cell_age t t_post) <
      tension_ramp gamma_base k (cell_age t t_ant)"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "S = v * T_HES7 ;  gamma(t) = gamma_base + k * (t - t_arrest) ;  t_ant < t_post <= t  =>  gamma_ant(t) > gamma_post(t)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5193(76)80131-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-05376-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2144-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05655-4> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Apico-Basal Differential Interfacial Tension Vertex Mechanics Driving Wedge-Cell Somite Rosette & Somitecoel Lumen Formation" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.segment_length" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_029.hes7_wavefront_arrest_tension_gradient" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> a skos:Concept,
